# LeakSanitizer suppression for the [rit-addr-mapper] test cases only.
#
# The native_sanitize job's last step uses this file instead of lsan.supp.
# Pinned Ramulator 2.1 (72427a1b) RITAddrMapper::create_base_mapper()
# (src/ramulator/controller/addr_mapper/impl/rit_addr_mapper.cpp:55) creates its
# nested mapper through Factory::create_implementation without add_child, so
# the mapper is never freed: a fixed amount per controller, once at
# construction. Test 704's two tagged cases construct four such controllers,
# reported as 2,028 bytes in 20 allocations. Only allocations made under that
# function are suppressed; any other leak in these cases still fails the step.
# Delete this file when the pin moves to a revision that frees the mapper.
leak:RITAddrMapper::create_base_mapper
